{"id":"46722275d707","path":"/en/university/organisation/student-corporation/updates/newsletter","lang":"en","title":"Newsletter","description":"Per gli studenti. Con gli studenti. La Newsletter curata dalla Corporazione studentesca informa la comunità studentesca USI sullo stato dei lavori e sulle iniziative della Corporazione studentesca con lo scopo di perseguirne gli obiettivi: rafforzare la voce e la coesione del cor","section":"University","crumbs":["University","Organisation","Student Corporation","Stay informed"],"image":null,"words":145,"alternates":{"it":"/it/universita/organizzazione/corporazione-studentesca/restare-al-corrente/newsletter","en":"/en/university/organisation/student-corporation/updates/newsletter"},"breadcrumb":[{"label":"Home","path":"/en"},{"label":"University","path":"/en/originalnode/8524"},{"label":"Organisation","path":"/en/originalnode/8519"},{"label":"Student Corporation","path":"/en/university/organisation/student-corporation"},{"label":"Stay informed","path":"/en/university/organisation/student-corporation/updates"},{"label":"Newsletter","path":null}],"blocks":[{"t":"html","html":"<p><strong>For the students. With the students.</strong></p> <p>The Newsletter “For the students, with the students” edited by the Student Corporation informs the USI student community about the work in progress and initiatives of the Student Corporation and aims to promote its objectives:</p> <ul> <li>give voice to and unify the student body;</li> <li>increase the possibility for students to contribute to university life;</li> <li>empower students concerning this possibility;</li> <li>strengthen the links between the student body and the University;</li> <li>contribute in general to promoting the well-being of students and a positive and supportive student experience outside the classroom.</li> </ul> <p>In addition, it aims to promote synergies between USI students and encourage student collaboration in Switzerland and abroad.</p> <p>Archive:</p> <p>Find an overview of the last newsletters<br> Links in the newsletter may be functional for a limited time only, beyond which content may no longer display correctly.</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://newsletter.usi.ch/ns_published/en/51\">For the students. With the students.</a></li> </ul>"}],"ctas":[],"nav":[{"label":"Student Corporation","href":"/en/university/organisation/student-corporation"},{"label":"How it works","href":"/en/university/organisation/student-corporation/how-it-works"},{"label":"Structure","href":"/en/university/organisation/student-corporation/structure"},{"label":"Direct democracy","href":"/en/university/organisation/student-corporation/direct-democracy"},{"label":"Budget","href":"/en/university/organisation/student-corporation/budget"},{"label":"Run for / elect","href":"/en/university/organisation/student-corporation/participate/candidates-elections"},{"label":"Initiatives","href":"/en/university/organisation/student-corporation/participate/initiatives"},{"label":"Referendums","href":"/en/university/organisation/student-corporation/participate/referendums"},{"label":"Vote","href":"/en/university/organisation/student-corporation/participate/voting"},{"label":"Submit an idea","href":"/en/university/organisation/student-corporation/participate/submitting-ideas"},{"label":"Monitoring","href":"/en/university/organisation/student-corporation/participate/monitoring"},{"label":"List of Decisions","href":"/en/university/organisation/student-corporation/updates/list-of-decisions"},{"label":"List of Initiatives","href":"/en/university/organisation/student-corporation/updates/list-of-initiatives"},{"label":"List of Referendums","href":"/en/university/organisation/student-corporation/updates/list-of-referendums"},{"label":"Calendar","href":"/en/university/organisation/student-corporation/updates/student-corporation-calendar"},{"label":"Student Corporation news","href":"/en/university/organisation/student-corporation/updates/student-corporation-news"},{"label":"